OL,3,GNEWSAHospital workers suspend strike
OL,4,Aafter talks offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA strike involving operating theatre
OL,7,Fstaff at four Greater Manchester
OL,8,Fhospitals has been called off after NHS
OL,9,Fbosses agreed to fresh talks.
OL,11,FThe UNISON union said the strike by
OL,12,Fmore than 350 workers planned for
OL,13,FMonday 14 September will not go ahead
OL,14,Fafter discussions with the Northern
OL,15,FCare Alliance NHS Foundation Trust
OL,16,F(NCA).
OL,18,FHowever, it said workers - including
OL,19,Fnurses, clinical support workers and
OL,20,Fhousekeepers - will still walk out on
OL,21,FTuesday and Thursday next week unless
OL,22,Fthere is "significant progress".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
