OL,3,GNEWSAHospital workers suspend strike
OL,4,Aafter talks offer
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe NCA said it was "committed to
OL,7,Fconstructive discussions" and had
OL,8,Fagreed to a meeting with UNISON on
OL,9,FFriday, but had "contingency plans" in
OL,10,Fthe event of strikes.
